values ($lx$law-offices-of-david-dai-tempe$lx$, (select id from public.business_categories where slug = $lx$legal-finance$lx$), $lx$Law Offices of David Dai$lx$, $lx$戴學正律師樓$lx$, $lx$Tempe immigration law office handling visas, green cards and citizenship, in Mandarin and English.$lx$, $lx$坦佩移民律師樓，辦理各類簽證、綠卡及入籍，可說國語及英語。$lx$, $lx$The Law Offices of David Dai (戴學正律師樓) is at 2121 S Mill Ave, #206, in Tempe. The firm's ad lists immigration and non-immigrant visa matters: work visas, tourist visas, student status, investor immigration, green cards, labor certification, re-entry permits, citizenship and family petitions. Service in Mandarin and English. Call (480) 517-0888. Advertises in Chinese in Next Weekly (亞利桑那州壹週報), checked November 2026.$lx$, $lx$戴學正律師樓（Law Offices of David Dai）位於坦佩（Tempe）2121 S Mill Ave, #206。廣告列出的業務包括移民及非移民簽證：工作簽證、旅遊簽證、學生身分、投資移民、綠卡、勞工證、回美證、入籍及親屬移民申請。可用國語及英語服務，電話 (480) 517-0888。於《亞利桑那州壹週報》刊登中文廣告，2026 年 11 月查核。$lx$, $lx$Tempe$lx$, $lx$Greater Phoenix$lx$, $lx$2121 S Mill Ave, #206, Tempe, AZ 85282$lx$, null, $lx$(480) 517-0888$lx$, null, null, array[$lx$English$lx$, $lx$Mandarin$lx$]::text[], array[$lx$Law Offices of David Dai$lx$, $lx$戴學正律師樓$lx$, $lx$Tempe$lx$, $lx$legal-finance$lx$, $lx$English$lx$, $lx$Mandarin$lx$, $lx$immigration lawyer$lx$, $lx$移民律師$lx$, $lx$immigration lawyer$lx$, $lx$移民律師$lx$, $lx$green card$lx$, $lx$綠卡$lx$, $lx$work visa$lx$, $lx$工作簽證$lx$, $lx$Chinese-speaking$lx$, $lx$中文服務$lx$]::text[], true, true, false, false, false, $lx$live$lx$, $lx$editor_verified$lx$, now())
